# FL-106: the HTTP cache's upstreams, one per line:
#
#   NAME  URL  MAX_SIZE  TTL_SECONDS
#
# NAME is [a-z0-9_]+ and becomes the path prefix /NAME/ on the cache; MAX_SIZE
# is an nginx size such as 10g. The Runner's configuration names the same
# upstreams under host_services.http_cache.upstreams, which is what gives
# Jobs one variable per upstream (EX-064).
#
# For example:
#   ubuntu https://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu 20g 86400
